    "caveats": [
      "Verify the porous membrane pore size and porosity support a confluent A549/HUVEC co-culture without cell transmigration.",
      "Confirm the syringe/peristaltic pump can hold a stable 3 µL/min (low-flow pulsation may need a pulse dampener).",
      "A549 barrier function is modest; if a tight alveolar barrier (TEER) is the readout, consider primary alveolar epithelial cells or a different line.",
      "HUVEC physiological shear is 0.1–1 Pa, far above the 0.03 Pa alveolar target — the endothelium here is deliberately under-sheared to match the alveolus, so confirm junctional markers rather than expecting a high-shear endothelial phenotype.",
      "Check PDMS drug/oxygen absorption if a transport or gas-exchange readout is planned."
    ]
